WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
When AI moves real hardware,
a wrong guess becomes real motion.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Tactevra turns one request into
one checked physical action.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A fixed camera reads four board markers,
placing every target in one shared frame.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The model proposes the action, named target,
coordinate frame, and confidence—never motor commands.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Deterministic gates stop stale or malformed plans
before the arm can move.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Units. Frame. Reach. Clearance. Freshness.
Every gate must pass.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Measured geometry resolves the H key
into exact board coordinates.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.000
The arm carries the stylus
and sends one bounded press.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Telemetry confirms the target, while the host
confirms the character H.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.000
That closes one shared contract, from intent
to verified physical action.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Tactevra.
Physical intelligence, checked.
